and the number of truncated ends, as \code{\link[=niche_truncation]{niche_truncation()}} reports them.
\item \code{shift}: 1 - Schoener's D between the environmental bins of the kept
and of all records: 0 = the same distribution in environmental space,
1 = no overlap. How far the design moved from the uncorrected one.
\item \code{niche_intact}: \code{range_kept} and \code{niche_kept} both at least
\code{intact_limit} (default 0.95; a rule of thumb).
